export const html = "<p class=\"lead\">In a modern warehouse, operations are optimised to the last minute and the last metre. But amid the rush to hit delivery SLAs and squeeze out every metre of space, one silent risk is routinely ignored: the structural health of the storage racks.</p>\n    <p>Racks are the foundation that inventory, operations and revenue all stand on. Yet they’re seldom treated as safety-critical infrastructure — until something fails.</p>\n\n    <h2>What rack safety actually means</h2>\n    <p>Rack safety is the practice of keeping storage systems structurally sound, operationally safe and compliant across their whole life. In practice that means:</p>\n    <ul class=\"clean\">\n      <li>Correct load distribution, with load limits clearly displayed</li>\n      <li>Regular inspections — visual and structured</li>\n      <li>Timely detection and classification of damage (Green / Amber / Red)</li>\n      <li>Preventive and corrective maintenance</li>\n      <li>Alignment to recognised standards — EN 15635, ANSI MH16.1 and AS 4084</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>It isn’t only an engineering or maintenance task. It’s a strategic operational necessity.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pquote\">Rack damage rarely collapses on day one. It compounds — quietly — until it doesn’t.</p>\n\n    <figure>\n      <svg class=\"art\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Damage escalates from a minor dent to a hazard to a failure if left unactioned\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <rect width=\"1000\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"930\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#C9D4E0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <g><rect x=\"110\" y=\"166\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#1F8A4C\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"136\" width=\"120\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E8A317\"/><rect x=\"570\" y=\"100\" width=\"120\" height=\"96\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C0392B\"/><rect x=\"800\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"136\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#7A1F16\"/></g>\n        <path d=\"M170,150 L400,118 L630,84 L860,46\" stroke=\"#5A6675\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"860,46 846,52 852,38\" fill=\"#5A6675\"/>\n        <g font-family=\"IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n          <text x=\"170\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#176B3B\">Minor dent</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6675\">Green — monitor</text>\n          <text x=\"400\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B07D12\">Worsening</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6675\">Amber — act soon</text>\n          <text x=\"630\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#C0392B\">Critical</text><text x=\"630\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6675\">Red — stop &amp; repair</text>\n          <text x=\"860\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7A1F16\">Failure</text><text x=\"860\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6675\">often, too late</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n      <figcaption>Left unactioned, a small dent becomes a hazard — and then a failure.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <h2>What it costs when rack safety is overlooked</h2>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F8A4C\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 11-4.5-3-8-6-8-11V5z\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\".6\" fill=\"#1F8A4C\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Safety</h3><p class=\"one\">People are at risk first.</p>\n        <ul><li>Loads placed on compromised beams</li><li>Small impacts escalate to failure</li><li>Unclassified damage makes daily work unsafe</li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F8A4C\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"19\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"4\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Productivity</h3><p class=\"one\">One weak beam stalls a shift.</p>\n        <ul><li>Blocked aisles and restricted access</li><li>Stock relocation slows operations</li><li>Repairs pull resources off core work</li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F8A4C\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M9 8h6M9 8c3 0 4 2 4 3.5S12 15 9 15h2l4 3\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Financial</h3><p class=\"one\">Failure dwarfs prevention.</p>\n        <ul><li>Lost stock, repairs, emergency buys</li><li>Downtime and late dispatches</li><li>Weaker insurance claims without records</li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <svg class=\"ic\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F8A4C\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12,3 14.5,9 21,9 16,13 18,20 12,16 6,20 8,13 3,9 9.5,9\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Brand &amp; trust</h3><p class=\"one\">Hard to win back.</p>\n        <ul><li>Scrutiny, media, regulatory attention</li><li>Clients reconsider partnerships</li><li>Employee confidence drops</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p>A single failure can cost far more than years of proactive inspection — and it only takes one photo of collapsed racks to undo years of credibility.</p>\n\n    <h2>Why rack safety gets neglected</h2>\n    <ul class=\"clean\">\n      <li><strong>“We’ve never had a collapse.”</strong> Until you do — and then it’s devastating.</li>\n      <li><strong>Too few trained inspectors</strong>, especially across fast-growing multi-site networks.</li>\n      <li><strong>No digital records</strong>, so deterioration is impossible to track over time.</li>\n      <li><strong>The OEM myth.</strong> The supplier builds to spec — but usage damage is the operator’s liability.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>The RAMS approach</h2>\n    <div class=\"approach\"><span>Proactive</span><span>Precise</span><span>Preventive</span></div>\n    <ul class=\"clean\">\n      <li>A <strong>Digital Twin</strong> of every bay and element, for structural visibility</li>\n      <li>Inspection workflows <strong>aligned to EN 15635, ANSI MH16.1 and AS 4084</strong>, with guided Green / Amber / Red classification</li>\n      <li><strong>Impact detection</strong> that flags forklift hits as they happen</li>\n      <li>A <strong>repair plan and bill of materials</strong> for Amber and Red items</li>\n      <li>A <strong>multi-site dashboard</strong> across every facility</li>\n      <li><strong>Audit-ready reports</strong> for clients, insurers and auditors</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"callout\"><span class=\"lbl\">The shift</span>RAMS doesn’t just inspect racks. It helps you manage rack safety as an asset — not an afterthought.</div>\n\n    <h2>Your responsibility — and your advantage</h2>\n    <p>Safe racks don’t only prevent collapses. They protect people, preserve productivity, and position you as a safety-forward operation. In modern logistics, <strong>proving</strong> safety matters as much as practising it, and <strong>documenting</strong> compliance matters as much as achieving it.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"cta\">\n      <h3>Not sure how safe your racks are?</h3>\n      <p>Get a mapped rack safety assessment with minimal disruption — and a clear, digital safety roadmap.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/company/contact\">Book a rack safety assessment</a>\n    </div>";
